MiniMax H3 Segment Studio
=========================

This ComfyUI custom-node pack is a GPL-3.0 fork. Full thanks and plugin list: CREDITS.md

Upstream bundled in this folder
-------------------------------

1. Songssx / Shi Xiongsong — ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-TimelineDirector
   https://github.com/Songssx/ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-TimelineDirector
   Material planner, finite segment sampler, Drift-Control, locked audio,
   SelfLift two-stage sampling, local presets, and the timeline frontend.

2. facok/comfyui-SelfLift and LBH-123-AI/Comfyui_Minimax_h3_latent_Upscaler
   Bundled under selflift_runtime/ (see selflift_runtime/NOTICE.md).

3. Local 16 GB work on top of that plugin:
   sequential first-pass sampling, windowed 2.0 refine, first-pass
   prompt/reference reuse, AIMDO CUDA-graph reclaim between windows.

Design reference (not vendored)
-------------------------------

- AIMixer / ComfyUI_MiniMaxH3_Director
  https://github.com/AIMixer/ComfyUI_MiniMaxH3_Director
  Overlapping-window continuity: encode 0.4, lift, re-pin previous 2.0 AV tail, T8 at output canvas.

- NikoDemon80 / ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context
  https://github.com/NikoDemon80/ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context

Separate plugins required by the example graph
----------------------------------------------

- comfyanonymous/ComfyUI (official MiniMax H3 nodes)
- kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes (PathchSageAttentionKJ)
- T8mars/comfyui-minimax-h3-audio-T8 (MiniMaxH3AudioConditioningT8 fallback)
- PT_H3ConcatAVLatent (AV latent concat)

Do not load the original Timeline Director pack at the same time:
node IDs are intentionally compatible so existing graphs keep working.
Rename custom_nodes/ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-TimelineDirector to
ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-TimelineDirector.disabled after installing this pack.
